cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, its models, or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Neuro_Nav: Real-time Brainsight TMS neuronavigation monitoring and cross-platform trigger pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Neuro_Nav is a research toolkit for transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS)
  sessions guided by Brainsight neuronavigation. It provides real-time monitoring
  and visualization of coil-placement drift, a cross-platform Mac-to-Windows
  trigger pipeline that gates TMS stimulation on coil accuracy, and an offline R
  pipeline that correlates motor evoked potential (MEP) amplitude with the coil's
  distance and angle from its target.
type: software
